  <string name="settings_help_about_title">About BatchIt</string>
  <string name="settings_help_about_body">BatchIt is a WhatsApp-style messaging clone built with Stream Chat, Firebase Auth, and Jetpack Compose. This free tier uses local settings and Firebase where available — no paid APIs required.</string>
  <string name="settings_help_faq_title">FAQ</string>
  <string name="settings_help_faq_body">How do I change my profile?\nOpen Settings → Account and edit your name or about.\n\nHow do I block someone?\nGo to Privacy → Blocked contacts and unblock users from the list.\n\nWhere do camera photos go?\nPhotos are saved to your gallery or app cache. Share them from chat attachments or Status.\n\nHow do I star a message?\nTap the star icon in a chat header to star the latest message, or use Stream\'s long-press menu for copy, reply, and pin. View starred messages under Settings → Starred messages.</string>
